Package: geomfeliscatus
Title: Cat-Themed Geoms for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Daniela", "Mieva", email = "danielamieva@dar4datascience.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A cat-themed geom for 'ggplot2'.  'geom_cat()' draws cats at
    x/y positions in five coats (black, white, tuxedo, calico and tortoise),
    supports a custom 'coat' aesthetic with an identity scale, and doubles
    as a worked example of extending 'ggplot2' with a new 'Geom',
    'draw_key' method and scale.
